---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HeroTitle from '@/components/HeroTitle.astro';
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';

import carSteeringWrap from '@/assets/car-steering-wrap-enhanced.png';
import steeringWrapProcess from '@/assets/steering-wheel-process.webp';
import steeringMaterials from '@/assets/steering-materials.webp';
import whyChoose from '@/assets/why-choose-steering-wrap.webp';
import beforeAfter from '@/assets/before-after-steering-1.webp';
import beforeAfter2 from '@/assets/before-after-steering-2.webp';
import beforeAfter3 from '@/assets/before-after-steering-3.webp';
import processMidImage from '@/assets/process-mid-car-steering.webp';
---

<BaseLayout>
<Fragment slot="head">
    <title>Custom Leather Steering Wheel Wrap Singapore | Five Star Auto Leather</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Worn or slippery steering wheel? Get a custom steering wheel leather wrap in Singapore for improved grip, comfort, and a refined finish. Book now!"
    />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="order-2 sm:order-1">
      <Image
        src={carSteeringWrap}
        alt='Porsche Boxster steering wheel finished with steering wheel leather wrap Singapore service in Onyx black with contrast stitching'
        loading='eager'
        fetchpriority='high'
        widths={[800]}
        sizes='(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw'
        class="h-full w-full bg-black object-cover custom-featured"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 flex items-center justify-center bg-black px-4 py-8 sm:order-2 sm:px-16">
      <div
        class="title-slide-up flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"
      >
        <h1 class="text-white text-4xl font-bold">
          Custom Leather Steering Wheel Wrap in Singapore
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 text-white">
        Is your steering wheel worn, sticky or peeling? Five Star specialises in custom steering wheel rewraps using premium leather tailored to your vehicle. Restore grip and comfort with a factory-restored finish or custom look.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-white">
        At Five Star Auto Leather, we specialise in custom steering wheel wraps using premium leather tailored to your vehicle. Whether you want a factory-restored finish or a completely custom look, we've got you covered.
        </p>
        <div class="flex mt-8 w-full justify-start items-center">
        <p class="text-white">
        Call us: <a class="text-white" href="tel:+6591729570">9172 9570</a> / <a class="text-white" href="tel:+6587909677">8790 9677</a>
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=13495479379412370960"
          class="inline-block w-50 ml-6 rounded bg-red-700 px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-red-600"
        >
         Visit our workshop
        </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

   <section class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-0 font-bold">Why Your Steering Wheel Needs a Rewrap</h2>
      <p class="text-center">Your steering wheel is the most touched surface in your car. Over time, constant contact with oils, sweat, and heat causes the original leather or urethane coating to break down. If you're searching for steering wheel wrap in Singapore, check for these common signs:</p>
<table class="w-full border-collapse border border-gray-300"> <thead> <tr class="bg-gray-100"> <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Common Sign</th> <th class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold">Why It Happens</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3"><strong>Shiny, slippery surface</strong></td> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">The protective coating wears away, leaving the wheel smooth and reducing grip.</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3"><strong>Peeling or flaking</strong></td> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Common on leather-wrapped steering wheels as the outer layer ages and breaks down.</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3"><strong>Sticky or tacky feel</strong></td> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Often found in entry-level vehicles where the steering wheel is made from moulded rubber or polyurethane rather than wrapped in leather.</td> </tr> <tr> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3"><strong>Fading or uneven colour</strong></td> <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-3">Constant sun exposure causes the top of the steering wheel to fade faster than the areas that receive less sunlight.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>
<p class="text-center">Most factory dashboards use a thin layer of leather or PVC bonded over foam. That foam breaks down in 5 to 8 years depending on sun exposure. All these issues are fixable.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="order-2 sm:order-1 sm:col-span-6">
      <Image
        src={steeringWrapProcess}
        alt="Technician's hands dismantling a BMW M-series steering wheel during steering wheel wrap service"
        loading="lazy"
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 flex items-center px-4 py-14 sm:order-2 sm:col-span-6 sm:px-6 md:px-20">
      <div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold text-left">Our Steering Wheel Wrap Process</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">See how a proper steering wheel wrap comes together, from stripping the old material to the final hand-stitched finish inside our workshop.</p>
       <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Step 1: Free Assessment & Quote</h3>
       <p class="mb-4">Bring your vehicle to our workshop or simply send us a photo of your steering wheel. As every wheel is different, we provide a tailored quotation based on its size, design and your chosen material.</p>
       <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Step 2: Safe Steering Wheel Removal</h3>
       <p class="mb-4">We carefully remove the steering wheel so the airbag, horn, steering controls, paddle shifters and other electronic components are safely disconnected and handled with care.</p>
       <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Step 3: Surface Preparation</h3>
       <p class="mb-4">The old worn material is carefully removed before the steering wheel is cleaned, smoothed and prepared for its new wrap. Any imperfections in the original wheel are addressed at this stage so the finish comes out clean.</p>
       <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Step 4: Handcrafted Leather Wrapping</h3>
       <p class="mb-4">Your steering wheel is meticulously hand-wrapped using premium automotive upholstery materials. Every stitch is sewn by hand to achieve a precise fit, consistent finish and clean factory-style appearance.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Step 5: Reinstallation & Final Quality Check</h3>
       <p class="mb-6">The completed steering wheel is reinstalled, with the airbag, steering controls and all electrical functions thoroughly tested. We also inspect the stitching, fitment, surface finish and overall feel before handing your vehicle back.</p>
       <p><strong>Typical turnaround:</strong> 4–5 hours for most vehicles.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="order-2 sm:order-2 sm:col-span-6">
      <Image
        src={steeringMaterials}
        alt="Dismantled BMW M-series steering wheel prepared for steering wheel leather wrap Singapore"
        loading="lazy"
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover custom-featured-2"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 flex items-center px-4 py-14 sm:order-1 sm:col-span-6 sm:px-6 md:px-20">
      <div
        class="title-slide-up flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
          Material Options
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-6">We offer a wide range of premium materials to suit your style, comfort and budget.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Premium Smooth-Grain Microfiber Leather</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">A clean, refined finish with a soft, luxurious feel. Durable, easy to maintain and an excellent choice for everyday driving.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Perforated Leather</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">Our most popular option. The perforated texture offers enhanced grip, improved breathability and excellent comfort, making it ideal for daily use.</p>
        <Image
        src={processMidImage}
        alt="Close-up of hand-stitched web pattern in blue and red thread on a custom leather wrap steering wheel"
        loading="lazy"
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw"
        class="h-full max-w-[400px] object-cover mb-6 custom-featured-2"
      />
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Alcantara®</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">A premium suede-like material that delivers exceptional grip and a distinctive motorsport look. Perfect for performance-oriented drivers, though it requires a little more care to keep it looking its best.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Custom Colours & Stitching</h3>
        <p>Any colour you want, with contrasting or matching thread. Red, blue, yellow, orange, white you pick your combination. For a custom leather wrap steering wheel, we also offer double-stitching, perforated centres, and coloured racing stripes at 12 o'clock (the "GT stripe").</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </section>

   <section class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-0 font-bold">Steering Wheel Types We Wrap</h2>
      <p class="text-center">We can restore and rewrap virtually every style of steering wheel, including:</p>
 <ul class="space-y-2 custom-list-width">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon
                  name="mdi:checkbox-marked-circle-outline"
                  class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600"
                />
                <span><strong>Standard round wheels:</strong> the most common design found across all makes and models.</span>
              </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon
                  name="mdi:checkbox-marked-circle-outline"
                  class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600"
                />
                <span><strong>Flat-bottomed "D-shaped" or thicker grip wheels:</strong> a sporty look built for performance-oriented driving.</span>
              </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon
                  name="mdi:checkbox-marked-circle-outline"
                  class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600"
                />
                <span><strong>Multi-function wheels with integrated controls:</strong> buttons for audio, cruise control and hands-free functions are carefully reinstalled and fully preserved.</span>
              </li>
                        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <Icon
                  name="mdi:checkbox-marked-circle-outline"
                  class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-red-600"
                />
                <span><strong>Wood or chrome trimmed wheels:</strong> the original wood or trim accents can be preserved, or fully wrapped for a completely refreshed appearance.</span>
              </li>
        </ul>
<p class="text-center">We work on all vehicle types, from Japanese and Korean makes to continental and luxury models, MPVs and commercial vans.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="order-1 sm:order-1 sm:col-span-6">
      <Image
        src={whyChoose}
        alt="Honda Fit two-tone custom leather wrap steering wheel in Peach pink and Onyx black"
        loading="lazy"
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw"
        class="h-full w-full object-cover custom-featured-2"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="order-2 flex items-center px-4 py-14 sm:order-2 sm:col-span-6 sm:px-6 md:px-20">
      <div
        class="title-slide-up flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-center text-center sm:items-start sm:text-left"
      >
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">
          Why Choose Five Star Auto Leather? 
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Choosing the right specialist for a steering wheel leather wrap in Singapore comes down to pricing, turnaround, materials and workmanship. Here is how Five Star Auto Leather delivers on all four.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Singapore-based workshop</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">If you are searching for the best steering wheel leather wrap in Singapore locals trust, visit our workshop. No send-away, no middlemen. You see the work happening</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Same-Day Turnaround, No Compromises</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">Most steering wheel rewraps are completed within 4–5 hours. Throughout the process, the airbag, horn, paddle shifters, cruise control and multi-function steering controls are carefully removed, preserved and fully tested before handover.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">Built for Singapore's Climate</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">We use premium automotive upholstery materials that are heat and UV resistant, paired with high-performance adhesives where required. Designed to withstand Singapore's tropical climate, they're made to look and feel great for years to come.</p>
        <h3 class="mb-2 font-bold">100% In-House Craftsmanship</h3>
        <p>Every steering wheel is rewrapped by our experienced craftsmen at our Singapore workshop — never outsourced. From preparation and hand stitching to final installation, we maintain complete quality control and back our work with a workmanship warranty for your peace of mind.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-0 font-bold">Before & After</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">See what a proper steering wheel leather wrap looks like on real customer vehicles, from worn and peeling grips to a clean, tight finish, all done in our Singapore workshop.</p>
      <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="order-1"><Image
        src={beforeAfter}
        alt='Toyota Prius steering wheel before and after custom leather wrap steering wheel service'
        loading='eager'
        fetchpriority='high'
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes='(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw'
        class="mx-auto object-cover"
      /></div>
      <div class="order-2">
      <Image
        src={beforeAfter2}
        alt='Mercedes S320 steering wheel before and after steering wheel wrap service'
        loading='eager'
        fetchpriority='high'
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes='(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw'
        class="mx-auto object-cover"
      />
      </div>
      <div class="order-3">
      <Image
        src={beforeAfter3}
        alt='BMW M4 steering wheel before and after steering wheel leather wrap Singapore service'
        loading='eager'
        fetchpriority='high'
        widths={[640, 1280]}
        sizes='(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 50vw'
        class="mx-auto object-cover"
      />
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-black w-full px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <div class="container mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col justify-center gap-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6 font-bold text-white text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Do I need to remove the steering wheel myself?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">No. We take care of the entire process — from steering wheel removal and rewrapping to reinstallation and final testing. Simply bring your car to us.</p>
      
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Will my airbag still work after the rewrap?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">Yes. The airbag is carefully removed and reinstalled during the process. We do not modify or interfere with the airbag deployment system, and all functions are checked before your vehicle is returned.</p>
      
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Will the new dashboard match my original colour?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">We aim to achieve the closest possible match using our extensive range of automotive upholstery materials and colours. While we cannot always guarantee an exact factory match, we can usually achieve a finish that closely resembles your original interior.</p>
    
       <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Will my steering wheel controls still work after the rewrap?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">Absolutely. All multi-function buttons, paddle shifters, horn, cruise control, and steering wheel controls are carefully handled to ensure everything works as intended.</p> 

      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Can you make my steering wheel thicker?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">Yes. If you prefer a chunkier grip, we can wrap over the existing steering wheel instead of removing the original covering (where suitable). This adds approximately 1.0-1.2 mm of material, giving the steering wheel a noticeably fuller feel.</p>

      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">How long does a steering wheel wrap take?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">Most steering wheel rewraps are completed within 4–5 hours, so you can usually have your vehicle back the same day.</p>
      
      <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl">Can I customise the design?</h3>
      <p class="text-white mb-8">Yes. You can choose from a wide range of materials, colours, stitching styles and even centre markers. From retaining the original factory look to creating something completely unique, we'll tailor the steering wheel to your preferences.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3988.6660102489027!2d103.8690919!3d1.3770706000000001!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x31da1658b06d3b7d%3A0xbb4992fe537bc610!2sFive%20Star%20Auto%20Leather!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sph!4v1782371450352!5m2!1sen!2sph" width="100%" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"></iframe>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h2 {
    font-family: 'RacingSansOne', var(--font-sans);
  }
  .custom-featured{
        max-height: 750px;
    object-position: center;
  }
  .custom-featured-2{
    max-height: 800px;
    object-position: top;
  }
</style>